' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/mundane-lives-dont-matter-so-dont-try.html?showComment=1470756488123#c6523057333425223622' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/mundane-lives-dont-matter-so-dont-try.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4310783478221522907' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4310783478221522907' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1772607359"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 9, 2016 at 9:28 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1150409701925971998</id><published>2016-08-06T09:26:41.252-06:00</published><updated>2016-08-06T09:26:41.252-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Cops are scum, and are members of a dangerous, evi...</title><content type='html'>Cops are scum, and are members of &lt;a href=&quot;http://blog.kentforliberty.com/2016/07/suppose-there-were-gang.html&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;a dangerous, evil gang&lt;/a&gt;.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4310783478221522907/comments/default/1150409701925971998'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4310783478221522907/comments/default/1150409701925971998'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/mundane-lives-dont-matter-so-dont-try.html?showComment=1470497201252#c1150409701925971998' title=''/><author><name>Kent McManigal</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/05005964583189815410</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//2.bp.blogspot.com/-XDS5j4fY-sM/Tt5wgUmUlxI/AAAAAAAAAUI/ZgGJCCjqSPg/s220/Me%2B11-23-2011a.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/mundane-lives-dont-matter-so-dont-try.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4310783478221522907' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4310783478221522907' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1703325864"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 6, 2016 at 9:26 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3818000810620873410</id><published>2016-08-06T08:40:02.475-06:00</published><updated>2016-08-06T08:40:02.475-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Watch and see, the warning of, going to a well lig...</title><content type='html'>Watch and see, the warning of, going to a well lighted and public area, will be what woman should do, not men. Never mind his wife was in the car with him. Now, it&amp;#39;s deal or railroad time to keep a civil lawsuit out of the courtroom. A change of venue would be the smart thing to do at this point. The system knows the citizen has been wronged but so what. This is yet another case in point that shows the contemptuous demeanor people in government have for citizens. The 3 largest lies now days are: 1, government is there to serve the people or we are from the government and we are here to help you. 2, traffic tickets are all about public safety. 3, a person can get their fair day in court. Explaining that because many don&amp;#39;t understand. A courtroom is a closed Union shop, the lawyers are all union members of the BAR. And lawyers have not allowed a &amp;quot;true bill&amp;quot; in any inditements in any courtroom for over a hundred years. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4310783478221522907/comments/default/3818000810620873410'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4310783478221522907/comments/default/3818000810620873410'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/mundane-lives-dont-matter-so-dont-try.html?showComment=1470494402475#c3818000810620873410' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/mundane-lives-dont-matter-so-dont-try.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4310783478221522907' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4310783478221522907' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1085988971"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 6, 2016 at 8:40 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7910712768601281357</id><published>2016-08-05T22:13:37.743-06:00</published><updated>2016-08-05T22:13:37.743-06:00</updated><title type='text'>“roll up your window, lock your door and call 911 ...</title><content type='html'>“roll up your window, lock your door and call 911 and verify the person is a police officer,” &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;--who will then either grab your window and break it, or smash out your window and seize you.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;“If you feel your life is in danger, drive away – still maintain the speed limit and obey the rules of the road – to a well-lit, public area and call 911.”&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;--at which point the officer will position himself to be brushed by your departing vehicle, or claim as much, and then empty his Glock 19 into your vehicle as you drive away.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Seriously, what idiots does this guy think he&amp;#39;s addressing?  It&amp;#39;s not &amp;quot;Comply, or die&amp;quot;.  It&amp;#39;s &amp;quot;Comply, and still die!&amp;quot; </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4310783478221522907/comments/default/7910712768601281357'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4310783478221522907/comments/default/7910712768601281357'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/mundane-lives-dont-matter-so-dont-try.html?showComment=1470456817743#c7910712768601281357' title=''/><author><name>frenchy</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00355101471427377248</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/mundane-lives-dont-matter-so-dont-try.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4310783478221522907' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4310783478221522907' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-376877358"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 5, 2016 at 10:13 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1287142958844871920</id><published>2016-08-05T19:37:05.851-06:00</published><updated>2016-08-05T19:37:05.851-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will,&#xa;&#xa;I&amp;#39;ve seen the same kind of thing here i...</title><content type='html'>Will,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I&amp;#39;ve seen the same kind of thing here in Utah: Police officers telling people to drive to the &amp;quot;nearest lighted area&amp;quot; or to an &amp;quot;more populated area&amp;quot; to verify the identity of the person pulling them over.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Every time I&amp;#39;ve heard this, I&amp;#39;ve turned to my wife and said, &amp;quot;That&amp;#39;s absolute bulls**t.  There&amp;#39;s no way a cop will wait for you to drive 1, 2, 5 or any number of miles so that you&amp;#39;ll feel safe.  You&amp;#39;re more likely to end up arrested or, worse, shot dead from trying to pull this stunt.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Unfortunately, I have heard others who have spouted the same kind of baloney back to me.  This careful regurgitation really irritates me.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I appreciate your efforts to demonstrate the near constant hypocrisy of those who are clothed in the robes of the state&amp;#39;s priesthood. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4310783478221522907/comments/default/1287142958844871920'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4310783478221522907/comments/default/1287142958844871920'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/mundane-lives-dont-matter-so-dont-try.html?showComment=1470447425851#c1287142958844871920' title=''/><author><name>Michael</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/mundane-lives-dont-matter-so-dont-try.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4310783478221522907' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4310783478221522907' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-283993619"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 5, 2016 at 7:37 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-313781051138592762</id><published>2016-08-05T19:01:51.049-06:00</published><updated>2016-08-05T19:01:51.049-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Note that CSPOA.ORG has now adopted a motto, polic...</title><content type='html'>Note that CSPOA.ORG has now adopted a motto, policy, or whatever or &amp;quot;COMPLY or DIE!&amp;quot;  Forget the Castle Doctrine that goes back to the Magna Charta</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4310783478221522907/comments/default/313781051138592762'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4310783478221522907/comments/default/313781051138592762'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/mundane-lives-dont-matter-so-dont-try.html?showComment=1470445311049#c313781051138592762' title=''/><author><name>tz</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14446437456939115403</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//2.bp.blogspot.com/_F0DRJg2NK8o/Ss1Hx9sb1cI/AAAAAAAAANs/4WtQjtj4hWU/S220/tzmin64x64.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/mundane-lives-dont-matter-so-dont-try.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4310783478221522907' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4310783478221522907' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1275847194"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 5, 2016 at 7:01 PM"/></entry></feed>